{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日発売された\nEX大衆で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん、ろってぃーと一緒に\n表題曲のダンスについて語ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスにこだわりある方だから\nこういう細かくダンス解説！的なの\nやってみたかったから嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/17/5509062/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを読めば\nライブも新しい見方もできて\nさらに楽しめるかもね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも乃木坂メンバーもいっぱい載ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/17/5509062/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、読んでみてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、おはようございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ昨日書いてたブログなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、寝落ちしてしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆は\n一昨日発売になりますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/17/5509062/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわたんフィーチャー回の乃木中の時の。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三四郎の小宮さんと写メ撮っていただいたよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の仲良しのお友達が\n小宮さんのこと大好きで\n羨ましがられたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録時間もちょっとだったけど\n独特の空気感があって面白かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/17/5509062/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の会いたい人って誰だろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたい人007 に出てる妄想をしてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなアイドルさんとか\n気になってるアイドルさんとかなら\n普通にイベント行けば会いに行けるしなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母校の先生とかも\n音信不通な人っていなくて\n普通に連絡とれるんだよねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは会いたい人っていますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}